5,Tibetan Music - Zen Radio,https://www.zenradio.com/tibetanmusic,"Each track is thoughtfully curated to evoke the serene atmosphere of Tibetan temples and mountain retreats. With influences from Buddhist rituals, traditional folk melodies, and healing frequencies, the channel supports emotional balance and spiritual clarity.",Hpon,Sino-Tibetan
6,"Tibetan Traditional Music: Folk Song, Sacred Chant, Heritage",https://tourtraveltibet.com/tibet/music/,"It is generally divided into five main types: folk music, dance music, rap music, opera music, and instrumental music. These categories reflect the versatility and creativity of Tibetan artists, each contributing distinct elements to the cultural landscape.",Hpon,Sino-Tibetan
